# cliloom
===
 CLILoom brings agent harnesses, visual workflows, and real terminals together in one desktop workspace. Quickly design, customize, and plan workflows that fit the way you work. Run your favorite coding agents side by side, with support for any CLI, including Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, Antigravity, Copilot, Cursor, Pi, Kimi, Qwen, and more.
